  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#ContrastiveExplanation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Answers the question “Why this output instead of that output,” making a contrast between the given output and the facts that led to it (inputs and other considerations), and an alternate output of interest and the foil (facts that would have led to it)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Contrastive explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://linkedu.eu/dedalo/explanationPattern.owl#Explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@value" : "Why choose option A over option B that I typically choose?"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Is there a ‘system recommendation’ that was made (let’s call it A)? What facts led to it? Is there another ‘system recommendation’ that could have happened or did occur, (let’s call it B)? What was the ‘foil’ that led to B? Can A and B be compared?"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#CounterfactualExplanation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Addresses the question of what solutions would have been obtained with a different set of inputs than those used."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Counterfactual explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://linkedu.eu/dedalo/explanationPattern.owl#Explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@value" : "What if input A was over 1000?"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Is there a different set of inputs that can be considered? If so what is the alternate ‘system recommendation’?"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#DataExplanation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Focuses on what the data is and how it has been used in a particular decision, as well as what data and how it has been used to train and test the ML model. This type of explanation can help users understand the influence of data on decisions."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Data explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#SafetyAndPerformanceExplanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@value" : "How has the data been used to train the ML model?"
  }, {
    "@value" : "How it has been used in a particular decision?"
  }, {
    "@value" : "What the data is?"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Is there a ‘system recommendation’ from an ‘AI method’ that has as input, a ‘dataset’ or part of it? Is there a ‘system recommendation’ that includes ‘object records’ that are used to train / test the ‘AI method’?"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#RationaleExplanation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "About the “why” of an ML decision and provides reasons that led to a decision, and is delivered in an accessible and understandable way, especially for lay users. If the ML decision was not what users expected, rationale explanations allows users to assess whether they believe the reasoning of the decision is flawed. While, if so, the explanation supports them to formulate reasonable arguments for why they think this is the case."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Rationale explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://linkedu.eu/dedalo/explanationPattern.owl#Explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@value" : "Why was this ML decision made and provide reasons that led to a decision?"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Is there a ‘system recommendation’ from an ‘AI method’ that has a ‘system trace’? Is there a ‘local explanation’ output that an ‘explanation’ is based on?"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#SafetyAndPerformanceExplanation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Deals with steps taken across the design and implementation of an ML system to maximise the accuracy, reliability, security, and robustness of its decisions and behaviours. Safety and performance explanations help to assure individuals that an ML system is safe and reliable by explanation to test and monitor the accuracy, reliability, security, and robustness of the ML model."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Safety and performance explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://linkedu.eu/dedalo/explanationPattern.owl#Explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@value" : "How has the data been used to train the ML model?"
  }, {
    "@value" : "What steps were taken to ensure robustness and reliability of AI method?"
  }, {
    "@value" : "What steps were taken to ensure robustness and reliability of system?"
  }, {
    "@value" : "What were the plans for the system development?"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Is there a ‘system recommendation’ from an ‘AI method’ that is part of a ‘system’ that exposes its design ‘plans’? Is there a ‘system recommendation’ that includes ‘object records’ that are used to train / test the ‘AI method’?"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#StatisticalExplanation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Presents an account of the outcome based on data about the occurrence of events under specified (e.g., experimental) conditions. Statistical explanations refer to numerical evidence on the likelihood of factors or processes influencing the result."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Statistical explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://linkedu.eu/dedalo/explanationPattern.owl#Explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@value" : "What percentage of people with this condition have recovered?"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Is there ‘numerical evidence’/likelihood account of the ‘system recommendation’ based on data about the occurrence of the outcome described in the recommendation?"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#SystemRecommendation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "An output of an AI system, generated by an AI task using an AI method, on which an explanation is based."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "System recommendation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/UnitOfMeasure"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4wear/WearableDevice"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#consumes",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "The relationship between a user and an explanation they consume. The domain, range and inverse are added in AFMO."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#user"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "is consumer of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://linkedu.eu/dedalo/explanationPattern.owl#Explanation"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#scientificExplanation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "References the results of rigorous scientific methods, observations, and measurements."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Scientific explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://linkedu.eu/dedalo/explanationPattern.owl#Explanation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@value" : "What studies have backed this recommendation?"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "Are there results of rigorous ‘scientific methods’ to explain the situation? Is there ‘evidence’ from the literature to explain this ‘system recommendation’, ‘situation’ or ‘object record’?"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo#user",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@value" : "Chari, S., Seneviratne, O., Ghalwash, M., Shirai, S., Gruen, D. M., Meyer, P., Chakraborty, P., & McGuinness, D. L. (2024). Explanation Ontology: A general-purpose, semantic representation for supporting user-centered explanations. Semantic Web. https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-233282"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "A person who consumes an explanation."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://purl.org/heals/eo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "User"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/UnitOfMeasure",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The unit of measure is a standard for measurement of a quantity, such as a Property. For example,  Power is a property and Watt is a unit of power that represents a definite predetermined power: when we say 10 Watt, we actually mean 10 times the definite predetermined power called \\\"watt\\\". Our definition is based on the definition of unit of measure in the Ontology of units of Measure (OM). We propose here a list of some units of measure that are relevant for the purpose of SAREF, but this list can be extended, also using some other ontologies rather than the Ontology of units of Measure (OM)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Unit of measure"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4wear/WearableDevice"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/consistsOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A relationship indicating a composite entity that consists of other entities (e.g., a temperature/humidity sensor that consists of a temperature sensor and a humidity sensor)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid28"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "consists of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthSensor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "V3.2.1: Add local restrictions on consistsOf on feature of interest"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/hasManufacturer",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A relationship identifying the manufacturer of an entity (e.g., device). The value is expected to be a string or a string with language tag."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has manufacturer"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "V3.2.1: Defined domain of saref:hasManufacturer to union of feature kind and feature of interest."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/hasModel",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A relationship identifying the model of an entity (e.g., device). The value is expected to be a string or a string with language tag."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has model"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "V3.2.1: Defined domain of saref:hasModel to union of feature kind and feature of interest."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/hasTimestamp",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Links a procedure execution or a profile to an instant."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid48"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has timestamp"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "V3.2.1: Tried to clarify definition of saref:hasTimestamp. Still unclear."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Applied on a profile, it describes the applicable instant of that profile"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "When the execution time and the phenomenon time are the same time instants, then DP saref:hasTimestamp can be used to simply link a procedure execution to the time of these instants, expressed as an xsd:dateTime literal."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/core/hasValue",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A relationship defining the value of a certain property, e.g., energy or power. Note that, even if numeric values are expected to enable reasoning, measurement values could use other datatypes."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.org/phmo#DiscreteObservation"
  } ],
